    "documentation_notes": "# MODELS AND NODES USED IN THIS WORKFLOW  \n\n---\n\n## 🟣 SeedVR2 (Down)Load DiT Model\n\n### Models are downloaded automatically the first time you use them.\n### Check the SeedVR2 Note. \n### The files are saved in: ComfyUI\\models\\SEEDVR2\n\n---\n\n## 🧩 Nodes Installed from Manager  \n\n- **ComfyUI-SeedVR2_VideoUpscaler**\n- **rgthree-comfy**\n\n---\n\n## 📚 Resources  \n🎥 **Tutorials:** [Pixaroma YouTube Channel](https://www.youtube.com/@pixaroma)  \n💬 **Community Discord:** [Join Here](https://discord.com/invite/gggpkVgBf3)\n\n## SeedVR2 model files\n\n### Repo 1: numz/SeedVR2_comfyUI\nMore info [HERE](https://huggingface.co/numz/SeedVR2_comfyUI/tree/main)\n\n| Model file | Size |\n|---|---:|\n| `ema_vae_fp16.safetensors` | 501 MB |\n| `seedvr2_ema_3b_fp16.safetensors` | 6.78 GB |\n| `seedvr2_ema_3b_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors` | 3.39 GB |\n| `seedvr2_ema_7b_fp16.safetensors` | 16.5 GB |\n| `seedvr2_ema_7b_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors` | 8.24 GB |\n| `seedvr2_ema_7b_sharp_fp16.safetensors` | 16.5 GB |\n| `seedvr2_ema_7b_sharp_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors` | 8.24 GB |\n\n### Repo 2: AInVFX/SeedVR2_comfyUI\nMore info [HERE](https://huggingface.co/AInVFX/SeedVR2_comfyUI/tree/main)\n\n| Model file | Size |\n|---|---:|\n| `seedvr2_ema_3b-Q4_K_M.gguf` | 2 GB |\n| `seedvr2_ema_3b-Q8_0.gguf` | 3.66 GB |\n| `seedvr2_ema_7b-Q4_K_M.gguf` | 4.76 GB |\n| `seedvr2_ema_7b_fp8_e4m3fn_mixed_block35_fp16.safetensors` | 8.47 GB |\n| `seedvr2_ema_7b_sharp-Q4_K_M.gguf` | 4.76 GB |\n| `seedvr2_ema_7b_sharp_fp8_e4m3fn_mixed_block35_fp16.safetensors` | 8.47 GB |\n\n### Notes\n- **fp16**: best quality, uses more VRAM\n- **fp8 (e4m3fn)**: lower VRAM, usually faster, slightly less accurate\n- **sharp**: sharper output variant\n- **GGUF**: quantized format, often smaller and lighter to run"
  },
